# Site conventions

This branch is Gervis Bermudez's Next.js App Router site (Arter CSS + React chrome). Production on `main` is still Jekyll at `https://gervisbermudez.github.io/site`. Do not cut over.

- Read `AGENTS.md` before large changes.
- Do not rewrite Elementor/Arter class soup or `public/plugins/`.
- Posts are HTML in `_posts/`, not Markdown.
- New CSS belongs in `public/css/styles.css` (or `app/globals.css` for Next-only widgets).
- In React, use `/uploads/...` with `next/image`. In post HTML, keep `| relative_url`.
- Run locally with `npm run dev`. Do not deploy this branch to `gh-pages`.
- Content voice: English, first person. Do not “correct” existing Spanish UI strings.
